# Trivy ignore list (image CVEs and IaC misconfiguration IDs).
#
# Rules:
#   - Every entry needs a comment explaining WHY it is accepted.
#   - Every entry is also listed under "Known limitations" in README.md.
#   - Prefer a fix over an entry. Never add an entry just to get CI green.
#   - Prefer inline `#trivy:ignore:<ID>` on the specific Terraform resource, so the
#     exception covers that one resource rather than the whole repo.
